# Colour selection, 2026-08-30 — _color-preview.html is generated by
# docs/color-options/make-preview.py. Deliberately NOT ignored: it is served so
# Luke's readers can switch options themselves on a Cloudflare preview version.
# It carries <meta name="robots" content="noindex">, it is gitignored so
# Workers Builds never sees it, and the only thing that publishes it is a
# manual `wrangler versions upload` — production deploys come from GitHub and
# cannot contain it. Add `_color-preview.html` below once colours are picked.
